1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,560
cap-evolve. Watch capability evolve.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,019
A benchmark gives you one number.

3
00:00:06,019 --> 00:00:08,738
It won't tell you which policy rule was missing,

4
00:00:08,738 --> 00:00:10,834
or which tool let a bad call through.

5
00:00:10,834 --> 00:00:11,570
So you guess.

6
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:17,778
cap-evolve edits what your agent reads: prompts, tool code, MCP surfaces,

7
00:00:17,778 --> 00:00:18,910
skill packages.

8
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:23,830
Each iteration scores a candidate on validation, reads the failures,

9
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,195
and proposes one edit.

10
00:00:25,195 --> 00:00:28,857
Accepted, rejected, or indecisive — always with the reason.

11
00:00:28,857 --> 00:00:32,580
This session is illustrative: its numbers are hand-authored.

12
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:39,176
One real iteration: a policy rule, and in the same edit,

13
00:00:39,176 --> 00:00:42,423
code inside the tool that rejects the illegal call.

14
00:00:42,423 --> 00:00:45,480
Task fourteen went from one pass in ten, to six.

15
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:51,149
The dashboard holds the whole run — every candidate, every trial, every verdict.

16
00:00:51,149 --> 00:00:53,820
Five rejections, and nothing beat the seed.

17
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,676
Here's what most optimizers skip.

18
00:00:56,676 --> 00:01:00,662
Acceptance is a paired significance test, on validation only:

19
00:01:00,662 --> 00:01:03,210
clear k standard errors, or it's noise.

20
00:01:03,210 --> 00:01:06,020
The test split is scored once, then sealed.

21
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:11,102
RH-SWE-bench: fifty-five point seven to seventy-three point one,

22
00:01:11,102 --> 00:01:12,814
past an unoptimized Opus.

23
00:01:12,814 --> 00:01:17,265
τ²-bench airline: fifty-three point six to seventy-one point two,

24
00:01:17,265 --> 00:01:19,730
and forty-seven point five held out.

25
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:23,080
Start in two minutes, with no API key.

26
00:01:24,930 --> 00:01:27,330
cap-evolve. Made at IBM and Red Hat.
